From d72f9b801ff11b4e22b85b4055e6eab9048700d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: joebereczki <41107035-joebereczki@users.noreply.replit.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Mar 2026 08:57:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 189/244] Prioritize the active web chat session for message
 injection

Always inject messages into the active web chat session (`agent:ceo:webchat:main`) instead of the general main session (`agent:ceo:main`) by ensuring `getActiveSessionKey` correctly identifies and returns the webchat session ID, regardless of its last updated timestamp. This resolves an issue where messages were not appearing in the UI because they were being sent to the wrong session. Also, updated version numbers for static assets in control UI HTML files.

